<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - Feb 17.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - Feb 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>Oechsle International Advisors, L.P. became a substantial shareholder in Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Limited on 28/01/1997 with a relevant interest in the issued ordinary share capital of 27,720,694 ordinary shares (7.14%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
</text>
